# Local dev secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in what
# you want live locally — `.dev.vars` is gitignored, this example is not.
#
#     cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# Every one of these is OPTIONAL. Leave a line out and that integration
# reports itself honestly offline instead of pretending to work.
#
# In production these are Worker secrets, not this file:
#     npx wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY

# --- Models Lumi commands (Orchestrator) ---
# Claude, for counsel and the council. https://console.claude.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Open models via the Hugging Face Inference router.
HF_TOKEN=hf_...

# --- Lumi's hands on your machine (Local Agent) ---
# Any long random string. The SAME value must be in your shell as
# LUMI_AGENT_SECRET when you run: node agent/lumi-agent.mjs
LOCAL_AGENT_SECRET=choose-a-long-random-string

# --- InMotion RP (Roblox city bridge) ---
# Same value goes in a ServerStorage StringValue named RP_SHARED_SECRET.
RP_SHARED_SECRET=choose-another-long-random-string

# --- Rotating a bridge secret (no downtime) ---
# Either bridge above accepts TWO secrets at once, so you can change one
# without breaking the callers that still hold the old value:
#
#   1. Move the old value to <NAME>_PREVIOUS
#   2. Put the new value in <NAME>
#   3. Update your agents / game servers at your own pace
#   4. Delete <NAME>_PREVIOUS
#
# Every call that comes in on the _PREVIOUS secret is recorded, and Shield's
# Authority dimension tells you whether anyone still depends on it — so step 4
# is a decision you can make from evidence instead of guessing. Leaving the
# window open costs posture score on purpose: it is two valid secrets.
#
# In production the same thing, as Worker secrets:
#     npx wrangler secret put RP_SHARED_SECRET_PREVIOUS   # paste the OLD value
#     npx wrangler secret put RP_SHARED_SECRET            # paste the NEW value
#     npx wrangler secret delete RP_SHARED_SECRET_PREVIOUS  # once nobody uses it
#
# LOCAL_AGENT_SECRET_PREVIOUS=the-old-value-during-a-rotation
# RP_SHARED_SECRET_PREVIOUS=the-old-value-during-a-rotation

# --- Growth connectors (real publishing) ---
# Without these, posts stay local drafts and say so.
X_TOKEN=
LINKEDIN_TOKEN=

# --- AETHER on Sui (set by sui/publish.sh after you publish) ---
AETHER_PACKAGE_ID=
AETHER_TREASURY_CAP=
SUI_NETWORK=testnet
